WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,040
It's just you people who are looking for some inexplicable things to do every day.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,920
When I was in school, all the housewives wouldn't let me practice early.

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,600
When I got to work, he tried his best to find me a husband and a boyfriend.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,160
I won't look for it. You are still anxious?

5
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,600
Find it, you are not satisfied

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,160
If you don’t hold it back all day long?

7
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,440
Always doing these inexplicable things, left brain beating right brain

8
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,960
can you speak nicely

9
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,280
I'm not wrong

10
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:26,830
Ban Fan didn't. Come back to the market right away.

11
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:30,560
The old man who helped us with things before now has the courage

12
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,340
If he trusts us, let's go over and catch him.

13
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:36,150
Okay, I'll come over right now

14
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:38,270
Brother Xiao, the old man came here just now

15
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:39,790
He also came with his neighbors.

16
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,590
It's just that they named you and said they were looking for you.

17
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:43,590
I can't do it here. Just let me inform you and go back.

18
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,390
Just let me inform you and go find them quickly.

19
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:50,460
Okay, let's go

20
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,180
Old man, Brother Xiao is here

21
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:54,660
Come on, come on, Lao Lin is him, Xiao Zhenbei

22
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:55,860
Never give up on this name

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:57,380
It was he who helped us move last time

24
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,980
It didn't take long to move them all.
